msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/citationIntentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "citationIntent is functional"
msgstr "citationIntent 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/citationIntentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:citationIntent is functional: a gmeow:CitationAct is made with exactly one intent — a second intent means minting a second CitationAct, not overloading one relator with two values."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:citationIntent 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:CitationAct 恰好带有一个意图——第二个意图意味着铸造第二个 CitationAct，而不是让一个关系体承载两个值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/citedEntityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "citedEntity is functional"
msgstr "citedEntity 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/citedEntityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:citedEntity is functional: each gmeow:CitationAct relator points at exactly one cited creative work — the single WEMI-tier target the citation is directed at."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:citedEntity 是函数式的：每个 gmeow:CitationAct 关系体恰好指向一个被引用的创作作品——即该引用所指向的唯一 WEMI 层级目标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/citingEntityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "citingEntity is functional"
msgstr "citingEntity 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/citingEntityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:citingEntity is functional: each gmeow:CitationAct relator has exactly one citing player — the single claim, work, module, or dataset that does the citing."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:citingEntity 是函数式的：每个 gmeow:CitationAct 关系体恰好有一个施引方——即执行引用行为的唯一主张、作品、模块或数据集。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/citationIntentFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:citationIntent names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:citationIntent 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/citationIntentFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/citationIntentFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:citationIntent, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:citationIntent, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/citationIntentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:citationIntentFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:citationIntent ."
msgstr "gmeow:citationIntentFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:citationIntent ."

